<!-- @after 7. Deep Dive: Chunked Resumable Download (15 min) :: animation -->
### Follow a download through a dropped network

<figure class="stepper" data-illustrated><span class="stepper-title">Three chunks, one interruption, no restart</span><div class="stage viz-stack"><div class="viz-grid" data-cols="3"><div class="node" data-el="caller" data-art="phone" data-art-role="client"><strong>App caller</strong><small data-text="callerV">enqueue(request)</small></div><div class="node" data-el="ledger" data-art="database" data-art-role="storage"><strong>Room ledger</strong><small data-text="ledgerV">empty</small></div><div class="node" data-el="worker" data-art="worker" data-art-role="queue"><strong>DownloadWorker</strong><small data-text="workerV">not started</small></div></div><div class="viz-grid" data-cols="3"><div class="node" data-el="server" data-art="server" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>File server</strong><small data-text="serverV">supports Range</small></div><div class="node" data-el="parts" data-art="document" data-art-role="storage"><strong>Part files</strong><small data-text="partsV">none</small></div><div class="node" data-el="final" data-art="document" data-art-role="storage"><strong>Final file</strong><small data-text="finalV">not present</small></div></div><div class="node is-key" data-el="event" data-art="signal" data-art-role="runtime"><strong>What happens</strong><small data-text="eventV">—</small></div></div><script type="application/json" class="steps">[
  {
    "label": "Enqueue is durable",
    "caption": "enqueue() inserts the download row in Room and then enqueues unique work named download-<id> with KEEP. Chunks aren’t planned yet, because the file’s size is still unknown. The queue entry now outlives the process.",
